---
description: "Use accepted project architecture and design context for typed UI changes."
globs: "**/*.ts,**/*.tsx,**/*.vue"
alwaysApply: false
---

For changes to matching files, follow root `AGENTS.md` and its routed `.agentic/` context. Load the project-selected architecture and design documents only when relevant. Preserve custom routes, accepted boundaries, approved components and tokens. A file extension does not determine the project's architecture. Report missing decisions or conflicting instructions rather than inventing requirements. This rule provides context, not runtime enforcement.
